# Paul Trap Analysis Functions

This directory contains utility functions used throughout the Paul Trap Analysis toolkit.

## Potentials
[potentials.py](mdc:PaulTrapAnalysis/functions/potentials.py) provides functions for:
- Calculating electric potentials
- Handling boundary conditions
- Potential transformations

## Spherical Harmonics
[spherical_harmonics.py](mdc:PaulTrapAnalysis/functions/spherical_harmonics.py) implements:
- Spherical harmonic calculations
- Basis transformations
- Multipole decomposition

## Gradients
[gradients.py](mdc:PaulTrapAnalysis/functions/gradients.py) contains:
- Electric field calculation (potential gradients)
- Higher-order derivatives
- Gradient-based optimization utilities

## Plotting
[plotting.py](mdc:PaulTrapAnalysis/functions/plotting.py) provides:
- Potential visualization
- Trajectory plotting
- Electrode geometry rendering

## Data Handling
[data.py](mdc:PaulTrapAnalysis/functions/data.py) includes:
- Data loading/saving utilities
- Format conversions
- Data manipulation functions

## Expansion
[expansion.py](mdc:PaulTrapAnalysis/functions/expansion.py) implements:
- Series expansions
- Multipole calculations
- Basis transformations

## Fitting
[fitting.py](mdc:PaulTrapAnalysis/functions/fitting.py) provides:
- Curve fitting utilities
- Parameter optimization
- Error minimization

## Utils
[utils.py](mdc:PaulTrapAnalysis/functions/utils.py) contains:
- General helper functions
- Mathematical utilities
- Common operations
